The Software is given free of charge, as a gift, by a person who is not in business, does not trade, sells nothing and accepts no payment or donation. No consideration is paid to the Licensor or any contributor. Giving the Software creates no relationship of supplier and consumer, agency, partnership, employment, advice, professional service or any other relationship, and no duty of care, support, maintenance, update, correction or response.

