Builds published on the alpha, beta and release candidate (rc) channels are pre-release: unfinished, possibly wrong or unstable, and used 100% at your own risk. To the fullest extent permitted by law, the Software, every build on every channel and every Output are provided "as is", with all faults, and without any warranty, guarantee, condition or representation of any kind, express, implied or statutory, including as to quality, fitness for any purpose, accuracy, completeness, security, availability or non-infringement.

## 9. No Liability

To the fullest extent permitted by law, neither the Licensor nor any contributor is liable to you or anyone else for any loss or damage of any kind, however caused and under any legal theory (including contract, tort, negligence and breach of statutory duty), arising from or connected with the Software, any Output or this licence. Where liability cannot lawfully be excluded, it is limited to the smallest amount the law permits.

